Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dust and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.06,0:00:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cash
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.21,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.90,0:00:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, I love you.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.50,0:00:31.76,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.76,0:00:36.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.39,0:00:43.06,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.06,0:00:47.77,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.44,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.91,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.84,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.84,0:01:16.47,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.34,0:01:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.14,0:01:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.47,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.50,0:01:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.22,0:01:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After rescuing the Gotsumon from\Nthe Digimon Emperor's prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.86,0:01:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon saw this strange\Ncontrol spire. Meanwhile,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.08,0:01:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Emperor and his Vegiemon slaves\Ncaptured Gabumon in a village of Gazimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red Vegiemon threw Gabumon into the river,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.76,0:01:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he was still able to call\NMatt and the rest of us for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.64,0:01:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We rescued the Gazimon by\Npretending to be prisoners,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.68,0:01:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the Vegiemon found us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Red Vegiemon cracked\Nthe control spire,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.20,0:01:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon was able to\Ndigivolve to Garurumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.88,0:01:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That spire was the key to\Nthe Digimon Emperor's power
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.52,0:02:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and our new mission is to\Ndestroy the rest of them.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.64,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fscx125\fscy125\pos(317,332)}Destroy the Dark Tower
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dark Tower, house!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.32,0:02:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where it is, it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.84,0:02:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.42,0:02:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.40,0:02:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dog! Dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, quit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.44,0:02:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all tired and need rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.50,0:02:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe someone should use this\Nwhip on you, you big bully.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.62,0:02:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Number one, don't ever talk\Nto me without calling me sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.68,0:02:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Number two, don't ever talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.02,0:02:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever among you can defeat this creature\Nwill receive a special prize package.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.44,0:02:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest will get some\Nlovely parting gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.46,0:02:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So who is up for the challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.46,0:02:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know all about Gizamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.56,0:03:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're amphibian\NDigimon with webbed feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.00,0:03:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their fins cut through\Nthe water like knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.50,0:03:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't attack me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.14,0:03:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was way too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.04,0:03:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they've defeated him, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.68,0:03:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now tell them what they've won.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.24,0:03:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.22,0:03:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's your reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.68,0:03:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all have the honor of being my slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.62,0:03:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get back to work building the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.62,0:03:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it, Wormon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to make me a hot chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.14,0:03:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about Gomamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.66,0:03:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.06,0:03:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've just got to climb\Nup this little hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.24,0:04:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, maybe it's not such\Na little hill after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.80,0:04:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.90,0:04:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, uh, uh, uh, Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.98,0:04:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Gomamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.06,0:04:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how about it, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.12,0:04:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all ready for that\Nbig anatomy test today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.06,0:04:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I spent the whole\Nnight looking in the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.08,0:04:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you, Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.28,0:04:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I just remembered that I\Nforgot to remember something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.06,0:04:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.58,0:04:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cody!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi, Davis. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.71,0:04:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.63,0:04:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.54,0:04:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.54,0:04:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got kendo practice this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.66,0:04:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Practice later!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.28,0:04:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The digi world's in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.20,0:04:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Davis, but my\Ngrandfather is the teacher,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.86,0:04:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he would be very disappointed\Nif I missed a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.92,0:04:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.90,0:04:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.94,0:04:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.94,0:04:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.04,0:04:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the computer room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.44,0:04:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.54,0:05:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, let's go. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.28,0:05:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and I together all alone\Nin the dangerous digital world?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.60,0:05:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, it'll be like my dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said I'm studying French.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.28,0:05:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Parlez-vous?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.10,0:05:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.52,0:05:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.64,0:05:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just got a message\Nfrom the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.76,0:05:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a distress call\Nfrom one of the Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.76,0:05:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not really sure yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.48,0:05:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.54,0:05:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The signal is coming from one of the black\Nareas controlled by the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.78,0:05:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's a lot further than\Nany area we've been to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.30,0:05:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this should add to\Nour frequent flyer miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to this map, the Emperor's\Narea is getting a lot bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.40,0:05:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet his ego is, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.70,0:05:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be long before he\Ncontrols the entire digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.16,0:05:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then every single Digimon is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.00,0:05:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I've had enough of this clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.40,0:05:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's all head to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.36,0:05:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we have to wait for Cody to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.70,0:05:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.28,0:05:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:06:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He says he has kendo practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.80,0:06:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One question, what's kendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.30,0:06:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you hit me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.90,0:06:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanted to know what Kendo is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.52,0:06:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.22,0:06:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you today, Cody?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just don't seem to\Nbe concentrating enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.54,0:06:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.90,0:06:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't lost interest in\Nthe martial arts, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.42,0:06:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or hanging out with your old grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.44,0:06:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can read faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.28,0:06:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your expression tells me that\Nsomething is troubling you deep inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.16,0:06:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your father acted the same\Nway when he was a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.90,0:06:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have been to many lands\Nand met many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in all my travels, I have found\Nonly one thing I can count on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.98,0:06:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prune juice! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.94,0:06:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, take two big glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.90,0:06:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.56,0:07:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want some? No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.54,0:07:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that my problem is\Neven too big for prune juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.58,0:07:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.10,0:07:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are others who are\Ncounting on me to do something,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.60,0:07:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm afraid I might let them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.38,0:07:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I once told your father,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.22,0:07:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,people will rely on you only to the\Nextent that you rely on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.56,0:07:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try your hardest and you\Nwon't let anyone down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.32,0:07:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.23,0:07:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to go, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.58,0:07:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.20,0:07:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem is too big for prune juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.46,0:07:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.37,0:07:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew Cody would show up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.84,0:07:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not Cody, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.08,0:07:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now everybody hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.58,0:07:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.92,0:07:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.60,0:07:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.51,0:07:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though Tai told me about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.82,0:07:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's still strange seeing the\NDigimon here in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.40,0:07:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Joe, our old\Nfriend we told you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.82,0:08:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.88,0:08:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.40,0:08:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you mind taking a\Nlook at my tonsils for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.14,0:08:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, this is Davis and Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.84,0:08:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe's not really a doctor yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.84,0:08:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.06,0:08:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got a distress call from the DigiWorld.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.20,0:08:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.11,0:08:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's from GoMama.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.03,0:08:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So your DigiVice was triggered, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.22,0:08:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you came. Candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.54,0:08:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, these are supplies for an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.96,0:08:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you plan on coming to the\NDigital World with us, Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.82,0:08:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could really use your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.12,0:08:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.03,0:08:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about Gomamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are the digivices\Nof the new Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.42,0:08:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the only things that can\Nopen the gate to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.80,0:08:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Izzy gave me a heads up about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.78,0:08:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he also told me all about this jerk\Nthat calls himself the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.26,0:08:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.18,0:08:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.50,0:08:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.07,0:08:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to have to forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.08,0:08:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's hyperactive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.40,0:08:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody, the gate's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.64,0:09:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.02,0:09:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, I hate the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.32,0:09:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari, are you okay? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.24,0:09:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but we weren't properly\Nintroduced before we took our trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm freezing my goggles off,\Nand you're introducing yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.48,0:09:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.46,0:09:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, you can use one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.80,0:09:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're hand warmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.88,0:09:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.79,0:09:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.76,0:09:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, leave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.06,0:09:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good old, reliable Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.10,0:09:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I watch all those survival shows on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.10,0:09:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't open!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.20,0:09:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.78,0:09:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.69,0:09:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Gomamon! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.42,0:09:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gomamon! Gomamon!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.90,0:10:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.90,0:10:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What day of the week is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.44,0:10:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Saturday. Actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.18,0:10:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's Thursday, but you never did know\Nthe day, so you're mad to your old self.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard from Tentomon that we could use
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.16,0:10:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that TV to contact you\Nif we were in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.58,0:10:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, it looks like you're gonna\Nwipe out my whole first aid kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.36,0:10:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always get misty at happy reunions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.04,0:10:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I actually think I'm gonna cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.26,0:10:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.17,0:10:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your tears will turn to icicles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.09,0:10:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really look terrible, Gomamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.64,0:10:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I mean that in a nice way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.06,0:10:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I picked a fight with the\Nwrong guy, the Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.06,0:10:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's built another control\Nspire here, too. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.60,0:10:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Digimon Emperor's secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.84,0:10:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hunts down Digimon and puts\Nthese dark rings around them,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,turning them into his slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the control spires supply\Nthe power to those rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.12,0:10:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And no one can Digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.92,0:10:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude, I'm gonna rip it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.28,0:10:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're gonna have to cross this ice if
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.30,0:10:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we hope to get close\Nenough to destroy it now
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.90,0:10:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what Matt means when he says I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.40,0:10:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,walking on thin ice Did\Nyou bring any skates?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.40,0:11:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need six pairs. Sorry. I'm all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.32,0:11:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.46,0:11:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any rope?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.54,0:11:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.66,0:11:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phew!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.02,0:11:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.52,0:11:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a great sled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.78,0:11:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now all we have to do is go for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.16,0:11:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's easy for you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.86,0:11:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're pulling. I'm no dog. Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.72,0:11:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.82,0:11:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.54,0:11:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now mush!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.16,0:11:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.58,0:11:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they're here? Mm-hmm. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.58,0:11:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gekomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.49,0:11:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a way to travel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.18,0:11:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.09,0:11:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got visitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.18,0:11:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, look, snowmen! How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.50,0:11:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, they're Frigimon, but\Nwhat's that around their legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.42,0:12:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can outrun them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.52,0:12:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.43,0:12:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our mission is to destroy\Nthe controls fire, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.32,0:12:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's better to keep going\Nthan to waste time fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.58,0:12:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they're attacking us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.32,0:12:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe's right, run past them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.00,0:13:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.91,0:13:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made it through!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.24,0:13:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aim for that hill!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.80,0:13:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They missed us by a mile!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.40,0:13:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's an alchemist!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.52,0:13:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Warming up yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.26,0:13:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drink this herbal tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.50,0:13:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 10% herbal and 90% tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.14,0:13:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.42,0:13:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, that Joe really comes\Nprepared. That's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.70,0:14:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait until you see him\Nduring hay fever season.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.10,0:14:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to leave Cody here. Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.86,0:14:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? T.K.'s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.52,0:14:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stay back here and take care of Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going too. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.60,0:14:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My grandfather told me if I rely\Non myself and try my hardest,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.82,0:14:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let any of you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.42,0:14:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not letting us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.72,0:14:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, you will need\Nto conserve your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.26,0:14:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.32,0:14:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got a long fight ahead,\Nand we're gonna need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.86,0:14:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.00,0:14:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.24,0:14:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be gone long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.70,0:14:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be back quicker than\Nyou can say Digimon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.86,0:14:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.18,0:14:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little tired. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.32,0:14:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could really use a little nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.28,0:14:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I vote we take this opportunity\Nto get some shutout.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.24,0:14:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.28,0:14:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel I should be out\Nthere helping the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.22,0:14:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know exactly what you're feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.92,0:14:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to feel that way too,\Nbut I thought it was nausea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then I slowly began\Nto realize something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.48,0:14:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of us are here for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.14,0:14:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a big picture that we can't see\Nyet, and I don't mean a widescreen TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.86,0:15:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So us staying behind is for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.32,0:15:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.06,0:15:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.32,0:15:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like my newest slave, Shellmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.02,0:15:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His aqua blaster attack shoots water\Nso hard it can demolish solid rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.68,0:15:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears I've discovered\Nyour secret little hideout.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.80,0:15:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gomamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.71,0:15:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I know the reason we\Nwere supposed to stay behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.08,0:15:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the others can have the\Ntime to destroy the spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.70,0:15:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to create a diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.56,0:15:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep him busy with some of that\Ngreat Gomamon charm of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.12,0:15:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.16,0:15:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did one Shellmon take\Nthe other Shellmon's lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.00,0:15:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it was shellfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.50,0:15:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you heard that one already.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.46,0:15:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the great Gomamon charm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.00,0:15:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to get down to business, B-Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.12,0:15:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.52,0:15:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimental Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.76,0:16:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,B-Mom, I'm a Digi-Bomb, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.96,0:16:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon monsters! Digimon\Nare the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.62,0:16:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.40,0:16:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.12,0:16:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon monsters, Digimon\Nare the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.96,0:16:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fladramon, the fire of courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.28,0:16:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.96,0:16:37.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.87,0:16:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no sense of humor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.79,0:16:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try the knock-knock jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready? You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.04,0:16:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor, energize!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.70,0:16:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon, Armor Digivolve, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.28,0:17:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digma!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.18,0:17:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digmon, the thrill of power!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.12,0:17:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor, huh? Not bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.56,0:17:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Gomamon! You're welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.98,0:17:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aqua Blasters! Cody!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.34,0:17:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.82,0:17:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.06,0:17:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fladramon, the fire of courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.14,0:17:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike three.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.38,0:17:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fladramon can handle\Nthe Frigimon by himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.72,0:17:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it's up to us to destroy the Spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.88,0:17:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but I think we're gonna\Nhave to do it from the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.64,0:17:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.82,0:17:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.62,0:18:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.42,0:18:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm never out of ideas or slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.52,0:18:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ebidramon here uses his twin scissors\Nattack to crush the enemy like a snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.42,0:18:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ebidramon, destroy them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.38,0:18:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there was some way you\Nwere able to digivolve,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.22,0:18:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's taking them so\Nlong with that spire?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.64,0:18:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Shower!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tempest Ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.20,0:18:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.11,0:18:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They destroyed the control spire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.54,0:18:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you can digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.52,0:18:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.43,0:18:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said they destroyed the control\Nspire, now you can digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.90,0:18:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a figure of speech!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.30,0:18:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.38,0:18:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.62,0:18:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.82,0:18:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.96,0:18:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.94,0:19:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.32,0:19:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold Rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.88,0:19:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.20,0:19:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finish him, Ikkakumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.50,0:19:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harpoon torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.82,0:19:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Gabumon,\Nyou're in charge here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.64,0:19:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, a frozen wasteland,\Njust what I always wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.54,0:19:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least you'll have plenty of\Ntime to practice your jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.24,0:19:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.36,0:19:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we'd better be heading back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we go, there's one\Nthing I just have to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.24,0:19:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.15,0:19:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.07,0:19:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our introduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.24,0:19:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, my name's Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.92,0:19:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.22,0:19:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.13,0:19:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My grandfather says that\Nnext to prune juice,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.42,0:19:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,manners are the most important\Nthing a man can have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.16,0:19:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, Cody reminds\Nme an awful lot of Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.94,0:19:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always honest and sticks to the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.10,0:19:54.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he reminds me of Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.98,0:19:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just loaded with curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.34,0:19:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Part Izzy and part me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.00,0:20:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a scary combination.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.64,0:20:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a split personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.76,0:20:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.67,0:20:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've destroyed another control spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.32,0:20:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that was a freshly\Nconquered area, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.84,0:20:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.80,0:20:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to go to plan B.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.16,0:20:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Wormon, what is plan B?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.28,0:20:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.19,0:20:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can all become friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.38,0:20:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not plan B, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.24,0:20:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't blame me, I can't spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.24,0:20:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he's home crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.94,0:20:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy, those mean kids broke\Nanother one of my spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.92,0:20:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fight's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.12,0:20:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, will you come back\Nand fight with us again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.34,0:20:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.56,0:20:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll even find the\Ndigi-egg of my own someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.90,0:20:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have to watch my cholesterol.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.14,0:20:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i was wondering if you'd\Nlike to come over to my house
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sometime i think you'd like\Nmy grandfather and i know
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.82,0:20:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he'd like you sure i love\Nprune juice is it okay if i
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.64,0:20:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,come over too i would just\Nlove meeting your grandfather
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.98,0:20:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if carrie's going i'm going\Ntoo you always have to
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.72,0:20:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do everything i do but you\Nand i are partners sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.58,0:20:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,davis but you already have\Na partner uh you mean him
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.98,0:21:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah you got a problem with\Nthat it's just not the same
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.58,0:21:22.70,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto matte mite dare datte kinou to maru de chigau
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.70,0:21:28.69,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto mite mite yokogao no shiruetto mo otona sa
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.69,0:21:34.60,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chotto kimi kimi iiwake wo shitai kimochi mo wakaru
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.60,0:21:40.77,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Datte yo no naka kore ja maru de natte nai jan
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.77,0:21:46.79,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Da ne! Kimochi ii kuuki wo
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.79,0:21:52.62,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima! Suitakute shou ga nai shou ga nai
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.62,0:21:58.35,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.35,0:22:04.34,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sekaijuu no doa akete oite hoshii
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.34,0:22:10.24,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ashita wa atashi no kaze ga fuku kara ne
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.36,0:22:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.24,0:22:19.10,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kimi no sono yowamushi wo mouretsu ni fukitobasuyo
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.70,0:22:29.50,Ashita Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous na jinsei wo!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.40,0:23:04.98,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\fscx125\fscy125\pos(317,346)}A Dangerous Picnic

